{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411250","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411250","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1241125001:1":{"text":"Haha, I'm not giving it to you! It's for Sonja!","source_cn":"嘻嘻，才不给你呢，这是给索尼娅姐姐的！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAF942505E76C0202","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Haha, I'm not giving it to you! It's for Sonja!","female":"Haha, I'm not giving it to you! It's for Sonja!","variant_male_record_index":"137675","variant_female_record_index":"137676","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241125002:1":{"text":"It's just seashells! They're everywhere on the beach, and Chippy collected some too!","source_cn":"不、不就是贝壳吗？这里的沙滩上到处都是，满满也捡了一些呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1EDB4F796BF2560","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1241125003:1":{"text":"These pretty shells make perfect eyes for dolls!","source_cn":"这是给布娃娃做眼睛用的，漂亮贝壳！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53BB686BD489C850","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241125004:1":{"text":"Sonja, let's make two more dolls—one for you and one for me! We'll sail to our new home on a paper boat!","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐，我们再做两个布娃娃吧，一个你，一个我！坐上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B8337001C139CC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241125005:1":{"text":"...Alright.","source_cn":"……好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E921614372D42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1241125005":{"text":"...Alright.","source_cn":"……好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82E921614372D42D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241125006:1":{"text":"I used to take Nara to the seaside to sail paper boats. I'd place our dolls in the boats and imagine them sailing across the sea, drifting far away.","source_cn":"我以前会带奈拉去海边放纸船。纸船上放上我和她的布娃娃，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19C54BF680F479C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241125007:1":{"text":"Wherever the boats wound up would be our new home.","source_cn":"纸船所到达的地方，将是我们的新家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC3C4038A2921C7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241125008:1":{"text":"Why did you want to get away?","source_cn":"你们为什么想去新家？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x986B3F67BC305D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241125009:1":{"text":"Back then, we struggled a lot. We went without food often and were looked down on by many.","source_cn":"那时候我们过得很辛苦，经常饿肚子，被欺负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2DC6A1A4980B95D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1241125010:1":{"text":"Nara found an old book in the trash that says there's a kingdom on the other side of the sea where everyone has enough food and warm clothes.","source_cn":"奈拉从垃圾堆里捡来的旧书说，海的对面有个王国，每个人都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84477251DADB54AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241125011:1":{"text":"She really wanted to leave Rustport and find it.","source_cn":"她很想离开锈锚港，去那个地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x168DDABBF1E6FF8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241125012:1":{"text":"But boat passage is so expensive, so I had her fold paper boats and told her that when she'd folded enough—","source_cn":"但是船票太贵，所以我让她折纸船，告诉她，等她折到——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEC55CADD087366F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241125013:1":{"text":"Once I fold 9,999 paper boats, I'll be able to trade them for a ticket!","source_cn":"等我折到第九千九百九十九只纸船，就可以兑换一张船票！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD301CB1FE4DC39A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241125014:1":{"text":"...Exactly.","source_cn":"……没错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6406C10124F2F5AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1241125015:1":{"text":"So Nara still folds paper boats to this day…","source_cn":"所以奈拉，她到现在还相信折纸船……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C8490934D3AC824","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1241125016:1":{"text":"I've already folded 5,000 paper boats! When I reach 9,999, I can leave Rustport with Sonja and we'll start a new life!","source_cn":"我已经折了五千只了！等折到九千九百九十九，我就可以和索...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x15F461EDD7FF88DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1241125017:1":{"text":"Sonja, I'm so much faster at folding them now!","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐，我现在折纸船的速度可快了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6907C200297309D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1241125018:1":{"text":"Wait! How about we head to the beach and launch the paper boats right now?","source_cn":"待会！我们去海边放纸船吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CE7F7D86F4FB2EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1241125019:1":{"text":"I don't know why, but it feels like such a long time since we did it together! ","source_cn":"不知道为什么，总感觉有好久好久，没有和你放纸船了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4534114FA9BD3592","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1241125020:1":{"text":"Okay...","source_cn":"好……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B674650C95203CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1241125021:1":{"text":"Oh, Sonja, don't let your eyes fall like that!","source_cn":"哎呀，索尼娅姐姐，不要垂着眼睛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D2C8085623E773A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1241125022:1":{"text":"You told me that if you often look down, happiness will quietly slip away from under your eyelids!","source_cn":"你告诉过我，经常垂眼睛，快乐会从眼皮上悄悄跑掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x171313631F6AB000","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1241125023:1":{"text":"You remember me saying that?","source_cn":"……我是说过，你还记得？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x454F8CD62D8549E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1241125024:1":{"text":"Of course, I remember everything you say!","source_cn":"当然啦，你说的每句话我都记得！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDC36BAD31D09412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1241125025:1":{"text":"Don't talk to strangers, don't sew stuffed dolls in dark places, and never say no to vegetables.","source_cn":"你不在家的时候不要跟陌生人说话，不要在昏暗的地方缝布娃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90C94E0521551652","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1241125026:1":{"text":"How could I ever forget?!","source_cn":"我怎么可能忘记！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD79CBD1BD39F193","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1241125027:1":{"text":"...It's me who forgot. I'm sorry.","source_cn":"……是我忘记了，对不起。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34599BE7F634E029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1241125028:1":{"text":"Sister Sonja, did I say something wrong? Why are you sad?","source_cn":"索尼娅姐姐！我说错什么了吗？你为什么不开心？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A85CDC02F2E6B23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1241125029:1":{"text":"Not at all... I'm actually very happy.","source_cn":"没有……我其实，很开心。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CCDFBA017B2EEF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1241125030:1":{"text":"Let's talk some more; I've forgotten many things.","source_cn":"来吧，让我们多聊聊，我忘记了很多事情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F5DD8AB1B96676","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1241125031:1":{"text":"Can you help me remember, bit by bit?","source_cn":"请你帮我慢慢想起来……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB78786BA71A47C10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"Doll?","source_cn":"布娃娃？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4F503531ECFBFA4A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Doll?","female":"Doll?","variant_male_record_index":"66992","variant_female_record_index":"66993","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"New home?","source_cn":"新家？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB6186C6142596E56","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"New home?","female":"New home?","variant_male_record_index":"66994","varia